      "value": "<p>The caster emulates the corrupting touch of a ghost. Your melee touch attack deals 7d6 points of shadow damage. This damage manifests in the form of physical wounds and aches from supernatural aging. Creatures immune to magical aging are immune to this damage. A Fortitude save halves the damage inflicted. Learned From Ghost and Shadow Elemental Family</p>"
